OL,3,GNEWSAOasis confirm Knebworth return
OL,4,Aplus Manchester and Glasgow live 2027
OL,5,Agigs
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter weeks of posting teasers on
OL,8,Fsocial media and underneath the
OL,9,FManchester sky, Oasis have confirmed a
OL,10,Fsecond leg of their smash hit reunion
OL,11,Ftour for summer 2027.
OL,13,FThe band will return to the scene of
OL,14,Ftheir legendary 1996 gigs at Knebworth
OL,15,FHouse to play four nights at the
OL,16,F125,000-capacity venue in September
OL,17,Fnext year.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
