OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOasis confirm Knebworth return
OL,4,Aplus Manchester and Glasgow live 2027
OL,5,Agigs
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey will also play a 11-night
OL,8,Fresidency at the home of their beloved
OL,9,FManchester City in June, after kicking
OL,10,Foff the tour with five gigs at
OL,11,FGlasgow's Celtic Park in May.
OL,13,FThe announcement dropped on Monday
OL,14,Fafternoon alongside a new trailer and a
OL,15,Fphotograph of frontmen Liam and Noel
OL,16,FGallagher. "Start the celebrations!",
OL,17,Fread a message on the band's social
OL,18,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
